Serena is a of Ash Ketchum in Pokémon the Series: XY. She first joined up with him in A Blustery Santalune Gym Battle! and officially joined him on his by Giving Chase at the Rhyhorn Race!. She is a Pokémon Performer who met Ash at 's Pokémon Summer Camp when they were younger. She had a haircut and a new outfit as of A Showcase Debut!. 

In Pokémon Journeys: The Series, she was revealed to have become a successful Pokémon Coordinator in Hoenn.

